{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-alerts-phone-screens-2-a-01","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-2","surface":"phone","area":"phone/screens-2","refs":["F-phone-212","F-phone-215"],"severity":"S3","title":"Settings says 'Reminders on, 6:00 pm' even when the phone blocks MettleUp's notifications, so no reminder ever arrives","what":"The Settings home row for Reminders only looks at the member's own switch. If Android has notifications for MettleUp turned off, the row still reads 'Reminders on' with the time. The warning and the 'Turn on notifications' button exist only one page deeper, on the Reminders page, so a member who glances at Settings believes reminders are working while every one is silently dropped.","expected":"When the phone blocks notifications, the Settings row says so (for example 'Reminders on, but notifications are off') so the member knows to fix it.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/app/settings/index.tsx:140-141","apps/mobile/src/app/settings/index.tsx:206","apps/mobile/src/components/settings/settingsLines.ts:179-181","apps/mobile/src/tracker/phone/PhoneCard.tsx:491-500"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"reminders-row-ignores-blocked-notifications","who":"members","how_often":"every time notifications are blocked","fix_line":"Make the Reminders row in Settings also check whether the phone allows notifications and say so when it does not.","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
